Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Kafka Connection Refused

Solution: Ensure Kafka and Zookeeper are running:
jps | grep -E "(Kafka|QuorumPeerMain)"
Issue 2: Topic Not Found

Solution: Verify topics exist:
cd /opt/kafka
bin/kafka-topics.sh --list --bootstrap-server localhost:9092
Issue 3: JSON Serialization Errors

Solution: Check that all Order fields have proper getters/setters and Jackson annotations.
Issue 4: Consumer Group Not Processing Messages

Solution: Check consumer group status:
bin/kafka-consumer-groups.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 --list
Issue 5: Memory Issues

Solution: Increase JVM heap size:
export MAVEN_OPTS="-Xmx1024m -Xms512m"
mvn exec:java
